<title>UK: Euromarket turnover rose in week to Dec 12 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover rose in week to Dec 12 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets rose to $1.061 trillion in the week to December 12 from $1.0281 trillion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     52.14		46.57</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     26.13		23.19</p>
<p> Secondary market:		 1009.10	     981.59</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    202.40	     168.18</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	774.91	     745.56</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    286.34	     282.26</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
